  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Repaso del nivel medio. Muchas combinaciones atacan a una pieza que defiende algo importante. Con la "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "deflection",
            "text": "desviación"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " la obligas a irse de su sitio. Con la "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "attraction",
            "text": "atracción"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " traes una pieza rival a una casilla donde estorba. Aquí la dama negra de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " es la única que defiende la torre de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Hoy verás dos ideas más: cortar una línea del rival y abrir una línea tuya."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "A recap from the intermediate level. Many combinations hit a piece that defends something important. With "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "deflection",
            "text": "deflection"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " you force it away from its post. With "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "attraction",
            "text": "attraction"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " you lure an enemy piece onto a square where it gets in the way. Here the black queen on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is the only defender of the rook on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Today you will see two more ideas: cutting one of your opponent’s lines and opening one of your own."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "3qr1k1/5ppp/8/8/8/8/1Q3PPP/4R1K1 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
